WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.302
Why did sociology appear in

2
00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:04.391
nineteenth-century Europe?

3
00:00:04.391 --> 00:00:05.922
Because the world had just

4
00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:07.401
been turned upside down,

5
00:00:07.401 --> 00:00:08.311
twice.

6
00:00:08.638 --> 00:00:10.959
The French Revolution overturned the

7
00:00:10.959 --> 00:00:12.563
old political order.

8
00:00:12.563 --> 00:00:15.396
The Industrial Revolution created factories,

9
00:00:15.396 --> 00:00:17.547
cities, and new classes.

10
00:00:17.886 --> 00:00:20.697
Auguste Comte coined the word

11
00:00:20.697 --> 00:00:23.199
sociology in the 1830s.

12
00:00:23.199 --> 00:00:24.626
He wanted a science of

13
00:00:24.626 --> 00:00:27.263
society, like physics for nature.

14
00:00:27.947 --> 00:00:31.447
Sociology tests ideas against evidence,

15
00:00:31.447 --> 00:00:32.929
and looks for patterns,

16
00:00:32.929 --> 00:00:34.597
not single stories.

17
00:00:34.933 --> 00:00:36.204
Your turn.

18
00:00:36.204 --> 00:00:37.936
Who coined the term?
